<title>USA: California $160 mln deal yields 6.40 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>California $160 mln deal yields 6.40 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $160 million California Housing Finance Agency mortgage revenue bond issue at a top tax-exempt yield of 6.40 percent in 2027.</p>
